/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The team carefully planned the layout to ensure functionality, efficiency, amd clarity. The ESP32 microcontroller was placed centrally on the breadboard to simplify wiring and maintain neat connections. Sensors were positioned along the edges for optimal detection: the ultrasonic sensor on the right,the infrared sensor under the board, and the servo on the top. The OLED display was placed at the front for clear visibility, while the buzzer and LED were positioned at the top to provide the process is working.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
